{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"gongsuntao-e-review-hanfu-letter","accounts":[{"id":"gongsuntao-a-b9b0e093c00bdf6d4732","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"馥以书与术称帝非孝灵子欲立虞","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-3f7c446e6f6552a4954d"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-e01e51d6d15e5c93bdfd","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"馥引光武故事谶纬玉印两日之说","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-35ffb965551fc4aadf3e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0058","role":"以书与袁术云帝非孝灵子欲依绛灌诛废少主迎立代王故事、称虞功德治行华夏少二当今公室枝属皆莫能及","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-3f7c446e6f6552a4954d","gongsuntao-q-35ffb965551fc4aadf3e"]},{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"受书者","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-3f7c446e6f6552a4954d"]},{"person":"wudi-p0079","role":"被称功德者","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-3f7c446e6f6552a4954d"]},{"person":"gongsuntao-p0057","role":"济阴男子、得玉印","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-35ffb965551fc4aadf3e"]}],"title":"《吴书》记韩馥书袁术请立刘虞","place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"韩馥致袁术书与旧库袁绍致袁术书发信人不同；同一立虞议题不能认定同一封书。","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-3f7c446e6f6552a4954d","gongsuntao-q-35ffb965551fc4aadf3e"]},"ordering_evidence":"gongsuntao-q-3f7c446e6f6552a4954d","source_order":[8,70,7],"related_events":[{"event":"dongyuan-e-p100a","type":"related","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-3f7c446e6f6552a4954d","gongsuntao-q-9fac2b611e458706d832"],"note":"同属推立刘虞议题，保留韩馥书与袁绍书为不同文书行动。"}],"order":1943}],"persons":[{"id":"gongsuntao-p0057","name":"王定","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-35ffb965551fc4aadf3e"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-35ffb965551fc4aadf3e","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-e0445b0ec5a9980feb4c","layer":"pei","quote":"昔光武去定王五世，以大司马领河北，耿弇、冯异劝即尊号，卒代更始。今刘公自恭王枝别，其数亦五；以大司马领幽州牧，此其与光武同。’是时有四星会于箕尾，馥称《谶》云：‘神人将在燕分。’又言济阴男子王定得玉印，文曰‘虞为天子’。又见两日出于代郡，谓虞当代立","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-30181e0ea6d86486fa57","start":68,"end":192},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-3f7c446e6f6552a4954d","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-e0445b0ec5a9980feb4c","layer":"pei","quote":"馥以书与袁术，云‘帝非孝灵子，欲依绛、灌诛废少主，迎立代王故事’；称虞功德治行，华夏少二，当今公室枝属，皆莫能及","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-30181e0ea6d86486fa57","start":7,"end":63},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-9fac2b611e458706d832","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-e0445b0ec5a9980feb4c","layer":"pei","quote":"绍又别书报术。是时术阴有不臣之心，不利国家有长主，外托公义以答拒之。绍亦使人私报虞。虞以国有正统，非人臣所宜言，固辞不许","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-30181e0ea6d86486fa57","start":193,"end":253}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
